                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Boy was I bored playing this, pushing through, waiting for something good to happen. You spend 30% of your time rewinding videos which considering total “playtime” really adds up. You literally going to spend a few hours rewinding videos. Then you watch people stare at camera in silence for ages. Nothing is happening. Then things start progressing and you think “finally” but it plateaus shortly after. There is no sustained intrigue, no rewarding feeling as you uncover clues. Some videos are so mundane and boring there’s literally nothing to be extracted from them. Overall this game is a soul killing drag.\n\nPlus it feels like the game is tailored towards men and as a woman I felt uncomfortable with this many sexualised moments that really didn’t add much to the already poor story. I mean, you start getting an idea of what is happening and by the time its all over you don’t feel like it was worth your time. I gave up.",
